{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hamster &quot;Hipachi&quot; rushes forward and collects &quot;seeds of fireworks&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A refreshing 3D rush action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/HipacheeGIF1.gif?t=1743128300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect a lot of &quot;fireworks seeds&quot; on stage!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break the block by rushing through the stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect a lot of &quot;fireworks seeds&quot; by defeating enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the stage, let's rush towards the rocket and set off fireworks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fireworks festival will be luxurious with the collected fireworks seeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/HipacheeGIF2.gif?t=1743128300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0A rush action that can be played easily with simple operation and buttons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If anyone rushes along the seeds of fireworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeds can be collected continuously!! It feels so good!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/HipacheeGIF3.gif?t=1743128300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm going to rush where I'm interested... I'll take a little detour...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be rare fireworks seeds hidden that are different from normal fireworks seeds!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you get a rare species, fireworks of a special picture will go up in the sky!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/HipacheeGIF4.gif?t=1743128300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let's rush well and get the &quot;Seed of Starmine&quot;!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you rush and defeat the enemy or break the block and accumulate the gauge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can get &quot;Starmine Seeds&quot;!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rush is powered up and you can enjoy the super pleasant rush even more!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can get up to 3 &quot;Starmine Seeds&quot; on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's aim for the &quot;Seed of Star Mine&quot; complete on all stages!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/HipacheeGIF5.gif?t=1743128300\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585330?t=1743128300","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/d67a8c9d3f332e20ab84747f5d798242a92bf9df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743128300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/b1261ed0e32db7b399ce5ae1d791e8e911961f25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743128300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/b1261ed0e32db7b399ce5ae1d791e8e911961f25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743128300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hamster &quot;Hipachi&quot; rushes forward and collects &quot;seeds of fireworks&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A refreshing 3D rush action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/HipacheeGIF1.gif?t=1743128300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect a lot of &quot;fireworks